Z||000008||Monkeyman||06-27-2000||01:08 PM||||Yup.  Us Hoosiers sure be smort.  We r thu bestt of thu banch.<P>BTW--Parts (all?) of AZ is on a single time, too.  Sure beats having to remember to change the clocks, etc. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
