Z||000010||DaveL||06-27-2000||03:50 PM||||Don't know about anyone else, but I could only set the time with the radio off. Push the set button, then the scan and seek buttons for the hours and minutes.||||reg||1
Z||000011||WGraffiKs||06-27-2000||04:38 PM||||And for those who don't normally play around with gadgets:<BR>to gain a few more preset stations-  Press two adjacent select buttons simultaneously after the "set" button.  Works for AM and FM.  Sequence only applies to OEM radios with pushbutton station select, not knob-type.  Happy listening!<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by WGraffiKs (edited 06-27-2000).]||||reg||1
